<title>SINGAPORE: Vietnam seeks Jul-Sep oil products - table.</title>
<headline>Vietnam seeks Jul-Sep oil products - table.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Vietnam National Petroleum Import-Export Corp (Petrolimex) has tendered to buy third-quarter oil products, an industry source said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tender closes at 1600 hours (Hanoi time) on June 27 and offers will be valid until July 4.</p>
<p>The details of the tender are as follows. (Volumes are in tonnes and cargoes on a cost-and-freight basis unless indicated with a *):</p>
<p>PRODUCT	     CARGO SIZE    DELIVERY	PORT</p>
<p>Gasoline 83-Ron   18,000	  Jul 25-Aug 5  Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>			18,000	  Aug 15-25     Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>			18,000	  Sep 5-15	Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>			18,000	  Jul 25-30     Hongai</p>
<p>			18,000	  Aug 15-25     Hongai</p>
<p>			18,000	  Sep 5-15	Hongai</p>
<p>			18,000	  Sep 25-30     Hongai</p>
<p>			18,000	  Aug 10-20     Danang</p>
<p>Sub-total	  144,000</p>
<p>Gas oil  *1.0 pct 20,000	  Jul 22-26     Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>	    0.5 pct 23,000	  Aug 1-5	 Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>	   *1.0 pct 20,000	  Aug 1-5	 Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>	    0.5 pct 23,000	  Sep 1-5	 Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>	   *1.0 pct 20,000	  Sep 1-5	 Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>	   *0.5 pct 20,000	  Sep 22-26     Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>	    1.0 pct 23,000	  Jul 22-26     Hongai</p>
<p>	    1.0 pct 23,000	  Aug 5-9	 Hongai</p>
<p>	    0.5 pct 23,000	  Sep 3-7	 Hongai</p>
<p>	    1.0 pct 23,000	  Sep 13-17     Hongai</p>
<p>Sub total	  218,000</p>
<p>Fuel Oil 170-cst  27,000	  Jul 10-14     Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>			27,000	  Jul 22-26     Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>			27,000	  Aug 2-6	 Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>			27,000	  Aug 13-17     Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>			27,000	  Aug 24-28     Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>			27,000	  Sep 8-12	Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>			27,000	  Sep 20-24     Ho Chi Minh City</p>
<p>sub total	  189,000</p>
<p>TOTAL		551,000</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
